+Replaces hash-table-based feature storage with explicit 3D grid and triplane textures to leverage hardware-accelerated memory locality and texture interpolation. It reduces the number of texture fetches per neural network evaluation by storing presummed multi-resolution features, enabling a 3× reduction in fetch overhead compared to the original InstantNGP approach. Choose this variant when hardware-accelerated interpolation is preferred over hash-table lookups.
 
